								<h2>KNU Sangju Campus Dormitory</h2>
								<p>The KNU Dormitory at Sangju Campus has 1 cafeteria and 6 dormitory buildings with a total of 534 rooms housing 1,314 (male 896/female418)undergraduate, graduate, and international students. It is equipped with a gym, a computer lab(each room has internet access), a recreation hall(cable TV, air conditioner), and a meeting room. There are laundry facilities on every floor. </p>
								<ul class="info">								
								<li><span class="tt">Contacts</span>Sangju campus: +82-54-530-1662~6</li>
